	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nOCHOfgEmeKR7f_32",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 12, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 11, HP 12, WILL 11, PER 10, FP 11, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nFPLtm16R27YggKpm",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 18 (offense 13, protection 5), threat tier minor, appearing 6."
		},
		{
			"id": "nY8XM01rzbQdD7zBR",
			"text": "Longbow: Longbow (12): 1d+2 impaling, Reach Ranged, 200. Volleyed on command from the rank behind. The damage is the bow's."
		},
		{
			"id": "nTuUySHde5SMSGniA",
			"text": "Racial cost: 79 points of traits plus 22 points of skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nxxgXUjQ4MGVI_IHh",
			"text": "Body weight: 200 lb."
		},
		{
			"id": "nkx2sFZIeVIrnkevN",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary)."
		},
		{
			"id": "nV54XLMVpmzjYj9Mz",
			"text": "Mail and a shield are standard issue and are not in this record's DR, so a hobgoblin met in the field is better protected than the stat block says."
		},
